  displayName: Apex V3 Systems Integration Prototype
  manufacturerName: Lunarlight
  vehicleClass: Balanced Systems Prototype
  layoutName: Rear Gimbal / Four-Corner Suspension / Active Aero
  summary: A complete Mainframe-driven craft with seven physical system computers,
    six sensors, firmware, passive suspension, active aerodynamics, and finite active
    cooling.
  drivingNotes: F4 toggles the systems console; O/P change pages. Physical hover
    and roof thrusters follow sensed track curvature and separation. Power starvation
    degrades software and sensor rates before hardware limits are bypassed.
  chassis: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 65dc5f347638c93458b7eb483589c53e, type: 2}
